// with corpus mint sites), NOT guessed family names. KEY GAP IN ROUND 1'S PARTITION: the label itself
// starts with application_, a prefix no family control covered -- so an application-shaped fatal other
// than the label PASSed every family claim as 'none'. Prime suspects by tree shape: (a) application_
// arity/order/label reasons; (c) arrow_body_does_not_inhabit_declared_return (its formal is
